# Agent Work Quality Rating Template

## Rating Scale
- **A+**: Exceptional - clean code, comprehensive tests, excellent architecture alignment
- **A**: Very Good - complete work, good tests, proper patterns followed
- **B+**: Good - functional, adequate tests, minor issues
- **B**: Acceptable - works but needs rework, incomplete testing
- **C**: Needs Rework - significant issues, rework required before merge

